{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44789","headline":"逢灵道士 · 护国","name":"逢灵道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浮丘山上见黄冠，松栢森森登古坛。\n一茎青竹以爲杖，数颗仙桃仍未餐。\n长安市里仍卖卜，武陵溪畔每烧丹。\n缩地往来无定所，花源到处路漫漫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"护国","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44789.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44789","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}